      propertyPath: dialogueList.dialogues.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[1]
      value: "s\u1EBD c\xF3 m\u1ED9t v\u1ECB anh h\xF9ng v\u1EDBi tr\xE1i tim qu\u1EA3
        c\u1EA3m, s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh v\xF4 bi\xEAn v\xE0 tr\xED th\xF4ng minh tuy\u1EC7t
        \u0111\u1EC9nh "
