      propertyPath: dialogueList.dialogues.Array.data[0].lines.Array.data[2]
      value: "xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n v\xE0 nh\u1EA5c \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c thanh ki\u1EBFm
        ra kh\u1ECFi t\u1EA3ng \u0111\xE1"
